    why: { en: 'The timer is computed from `startedAt`, not by adding one each tick, so it stays correct even if the tab is throttled in the background. The interval is cleared when the run ends.', id: 'Timer dihitung dari `startedAt`, bukan dengan menambah satu tiap tick, jadi tetap benar walau tab diperlambat di latar belakang. Interval dibersihkan saat run selesai.' },
